# Day 27/60 — AI Prior Authorization Story Simulator

## Objective

Today I expanded yesterday's healthcare workflow simulator by transforming it into an interactive storytelling experience.

Instead of simply following workflow steps, users progress through a realistic healthcare journey where each decision influences the overall experience while learning how prior authorization works.

---

## What Was Generated

- AI Prior Authorization Story Simulator
- Interactive Patient Journey
- Branching Decision Paths
- Healthcare Education Interface
- Progress Tracking System
- Multiple Story Outcomes
- Educational Explanations
- Interactive HTML Application

---

## What I Learned

### Storytelling Improves Learning

Interactive narratives make complicated healthcare workflows much easier to understand compared to static diagrams.

### User Decisions Increase Engagement

Allowing users to choose different paths creates a more immersive learning experience.

### AI Accelerates Educational App Development

AI can quickly generate realistic scenarios that combine education with interactive design.

### Better UX Through Context

Explaining *why* each healthcare step exists helps users build a deeper understanding of the overall process.

